    dct:description "Dispersion, boundary conditions, sweep, ablation, and specimen segmentation are each a named function whose docstring or comments point at Eq. 3.1, Table 1, or the specimen operator. Lean theorems state the wavelength, the diffusivity product, the proximal ordering, and the width ordering." ;
