<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bicyclus-anynana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sekimura et al. (2015) Gierer–Meinhardt wing-cell focus at λ_c = 1.507 mm (pass 2 controls) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The scored run uses Table 1 and Eq. 3.1–3.2, including vein Dirichlet data 2 a1_ss, proximal k_p a1_ss, and zero-flux inhibitor. σ(k) is the eigenvalue of that Jacobian. Pigment hue in the GIF is a photographic readout, which is why this is not 100." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
